{
  "title": "Aromatic Syrian Chicken Skillet",
  "description": "A peppery and springy Syrian dish featuring chicken thighs and confit-tomato, perfect for a brunch mood, this recipe is sugar-free-friendly.",
  "cuisine": "Syrian",
